MixedDeepMM is distributed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or later (GPL >= 3), as declared in DESCRIPTION.

The continuous deep Gaussian model code includes adaptations of the
open-source R package deepgmm (GPL >= 3), by Cinzia Viroli and Geoffrey J.
McLachlan; the upstream CRAN package was maintained by Suren Rathnayake.
Upstream reference: https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=deepgmm

Additional robust, skew-t, mixed-response, diagnostic, and integration code
originates from the research source archive and MixedDeepMM development.
Code ancestry and scientific limitations are described in
inst/references/PROVENANCE.md and inst/MODEL_SCOPE.md.

This notice documents upstream credit and the release license; it does not
supersede or remove any applicable third-party copyright.
